  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *fijado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to fix,\" \"to set,\" or \"to fasten\" — *fijar la fecha* (to set the date), *fijar un cartel en la pared* (to fasten a poster to the wall)",
    "Reflexive *fijarse (en)* is extremely common and means \"to notice\" or \"to pay attention (to)\": *fíjate en los detalles* (notice the details), *no me fijé en la hora* (I didn't notice the time)",
    "Related: *fijo/a* (fixed, permanent — *un trabajo fijo* = a permanent job), *fijación* (fixation), *fijamente* (fixedly, intently)"
  ],
